          "short": "$x^n$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a^{n\\log_a x}&=\\left(a^{\\log_a x}\\right)^n\\\\a^{n\\log_a x}&=x^n\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
